<title>USA: Trenton Savings sets acquisition.</title>
<headline>Trenton Savings sets acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LAWRENCEVILLE, N.J. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trenton Savings Bank FSB said Thursday it signed a letter of intent to acquire Manchester Trust Bank for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Trenton Savings said the terms of the acquisition are subject to the negotiation of a definitive acquisition agreement.</p>
<p>It said Manchester manages over $125 million in trust assets. Its offices in Lakehurst and Tinton Falls, N.J., employ 10 people.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
